otes energy market reforms, technological neutrality, and measures that improve grid resilience as a means of achieving environmental sustainability. The integration of hydrogen energy into smart infrastructure is facilitated by AI, and strategic planning and collaborative design are crucial for achieving a resilient, sustainable, and efficient energy future. This article provides a strategic plan for efficiently handling complexities, leveraging advantageous situations, and collaboratively building an energy industry that is adaptable, productive, and environmentally aware. © 2024 Hydrogen Energy Publications LLC},
